OL,3,GNEWSAWhat will happen to coastal cliff
OL,4,Alifts?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo capital funding has been identified
OL,7,Fto reopen and repair cliff lifts at
OL,8,Fcoastal resorts in North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe Scarborough's Spa Cliff Lift, one
OL,11,Fof Britain's oldest funicular railways,
OL,12,Fwas shut in August after engineers
OL,13,Fidentified a number of safety issues.
OL,15,FWhitby's lift closed in April 2022 due
OL,16,Fto severe corrosion, water ingress and
OL,17,Fstructural defects. At the time,
OL,18,Freopening costs were estimated at
OL,19,F#4.58m, although officers warned the
OL,20,Ffinal figure could be significantly
OL,21,Fhigher.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
