OL,3,GNEWSAWhat will happen to coastal cliff
OL,4,Alifts?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new interim report for North
OL,7,FYorkshire Council stated there was "no
OL,8,Fcapital funding allocated for these
OL,9,Frepairs", and if the works were taken
OL,10,Fforward, a funding source "would need
OL,11,Fto be identified".
